              "type": "p",
              "text": "Prepare for obstacles while there is time to think clearly. A plan deserves consideration under less favourable conditions: a late finish, an interrupted routine, an unavailable resource or a day with little energy. These possibilities belong in the planning, especially when they have disrupted the same intention before."
